  ProjectName: Casa da Cerveja
  ClientName: SuperBock
  Tags: 68
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: 'Super Bock is Portugal''s best-selling beer brand worldwide, produced
      by the Super Bock Group since 1927.

      

'
  - category: 2
    info: 'Casa da Cerveja is a visitor tour inside the Super Bock Group production
      centre. This AR app brings the group''s original brewing room back to life,
      walking visitors through the whole process: raw materials, wort production,
      fermentation, and bottling.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: 'The experience could only be tested on-site, in the museum. Placing 3D
      models accurately relative to the real room was slow and hard to iterate on.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Built a developer placement tool that measured the device''s position
      relative to the AR marker on-site and saved it.

      - Used those saved
      positions back in the studio to place models in the scene. It wasn''t perfect,
      but it made the initial layout much faster and simpler.'
